# INVENDQ.KEY - a key script of INVWIN (SRC/WIN/INVWIN.C) over a link to
# INVSERV on the data TEST/KEYS/SEED.REQ seeds, run by
# TEST/INTEG/wintcp.sh with /TCP:: a login at level 3, then Windows ends
# its session (Q) with the item list open.  The frame agrees and closes
# the link from its WM_ENDSESSION, the bridge then saying CLOSE TCP, and
# the run ends there.  Windows for Workgroups writes
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVTCPQ.SNP.
T ADMIN
K TAB
K SHIFT-R E T R O 1 9 8 6
K ENTER
S LIST
Q
S ENDED
